= Security Guardrails for Continuous ML Integration
== Abstract
This paper presents a lightweight secure-ML CI pattern that combines static checks, artifact hashing, and policy gates. We demonstrate practical risk reduction with minimal computational overhead.

== Method
Run dependency scan stubs, hash verification, and policy scoring over artifacts.

== Experiments
We run a CPU-only benchmark with fixed seed and report accuracy.

== Limitations
Small synthetic/curated data and simplified metrics reduce external validity.

== Ethical Considerations
The tool is intended for decision support; human oversight is required.
